# W7b, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; its link is cut (the proxy cuts a for 70 s: the instance ends at 60 s (host_lost), b goes home, a goes home after its reconnect).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@195
idle until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@330
log a home after its reconnect
